        "title": "Will you miss the Walkie-Talkie Apple Watch app when watchOS 27 drops push-to-talk?",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/10/will-you-miss-the-walkie-talkie-apple-watch-app-when-watchos-27-drops-push-to-talk/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/07/walkie-talkie.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple Watch is losing its Walkie-Talkie app in this fall’s watchOS 27 software update. Will you miss the Apple Watch push-to-talk functionality? </p>",
        "type": "Technology",
        "source": "9to5Mac"
