        "title": "The Frontend Verification Gap in AI-Assisted Development",
        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/the-frontend-verification-gap-in-ai-assisted-development/",
        "content_text": "AI-assisted development has made frontend work feel much faster. A developer can ask for a form, a dashboard card, a table, a modal, or a responsive layout and get a decent first version almost immediately. The code may compile. The page may render. At first glance, the UI may look done. But frontend developers know [&#8230;]",
